Maps Expanded
=============

This project is **Maps Expanded** — a standalone SPT mod (client + optional
server mod). It is not DynamicMaps, or DynamicMaps Extended.

As of 2.0.0 the plugin and server software implementation is Maps Expanded's
own work (session, canvas, cameras, pin sources, pin board, raid events, map
library, build check, quest utilities, faction colours, aliases, and server
policy / paper-map registration).

Earlier releases adapted MIT-licensed software from DynamicMaps /
SPT-DynamicMaps and DynamicMaps Extended. That adapted software has been
replaced. Those projects remain historically related and are thanked for the
ideas and for the map packs redistributed under the third-party terms below.

Map artwork and data packs are NOT MIT — see THIRD-PARTY.md (Tarkov.dev SVG
CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, Icebreaker CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, Extended packaged maps, etc.).
Filenames and credit files that mention upstream authors stay where the map
licences require them.

This NOTICE must be retained with redistributions of Maps Expanded.
